{"bangumi":{"date":"2012-06-02","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/51/ab/23626_RRhJb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/51/ab/23626_RRhJb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/51/ab/23626_RRhJb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/51/ab/23626_RRhJb.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/51/ab/23626_RRhJb.jpg"},"summary":"电影《Blood-C The Last Dark》将于2012年6月2日上映。由Production I.G动画制作，松竹国际发行。日本映伦评级为PG12。\r\n\r\n在电影版中，延续了电视动画版中的黑幕阴谋事件完结后的故事，与之独立成篇。\r\n\r\n本来《BLOOD-C》的企划中发展初期，曾考虑过以电影或以OVA两种方式延续故事。之后，经CLAMP参与后决定了实际内容，决定以电视动画版，后接电影版来发展。本作电视动画版播出时就传出了电影版的消息，到了电视动画版最后一集完结时公开电影版正式上映日期。\r\n\r\n本片是日本文化厅自2011年启动文化振兴政策的“国际共同电影制作支援事业”中，启动第一年的制作支援对象作品之一，由日本政府注资5千万日元的补助金开拍。\r\n\r\n本片为2012年第16届加拿大蒙特利尔幻想电影节，及第16届韩国富川国际奇幻电影节参展作品。","name":"劇場版 BLOOD-C The Last Dark","name_cn":"BLOOD-C The Last Dark","tags":[{"name":"剧场版","count":468,"total_count":722094},{"name":"CLAMP","count":282,"total_count":17882},{"name":"BLOOD-C","count":244,"total_count":747},{"name":"血腥","count":199,"total_count":8068},{"name":"猎奇","count":186,"total_count":37053},{"name":"水树奈奈","count":170,"total_count":6564},{"name":"2012","count":163,"total_count":55482},{"name":"ProductionI.G","count":149,"total_count":35088},{"name":"原创","count":131,"total_count":617895},{"name":"Production.I.G","count":85,"total_count":42232},{"name":"BLOOD-C剧场版","count":64,"total_count":65},{"name":"战斗","count":60,"total_count":469224},{"name":"花泽香菜","count":42,"total_count":43246},{"name":"四大婶","count":18,"total_count":18},{"name":"奇幻","count":16,"total_count":468481},{"name":"BLOOD","count":16,"total_count":342},{"name":"2012年","count":10,"total_count":3303},{"name":"爱的战士虚渊玄","count":10,"total_count":2096},{"name":"塩谷直義","count":8,"total_count":256},{"name":"2012年6月","count":7,"total_count":375},{"name":"小夜","count":7,"total_count":82},{"name":"神谷浩史","count":6,"total_count":29860},{"name":"盐谷直义","count":5,"total_count":316},{"name":"梶裕贵","count":4